    <node unique_id="1" master_id="0" name="Project Overview" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
      <rich_text>STUDENT INFORMATION SYSTEM (SIS)
Group: Klink Klank Klan
Repository: https://github.com/gabaga1926/Student-Information-System

WHAT IT IS
A desktop application built with C# Windows Forms and MySQL. It works as a central directory for student records and was built as the CS Midterm Project. The WinForms UI talks to a MySQL database through a small repository class that uses parameterized queries.

CURRENT FEATURE STATUS (as of the latest main branch, Oct 23 2026)
  [DONE]    Add student
  [DONE]    Update student
  [DONE]    Delete student (with confirmation dialog)
  [DONE]    Clear form
  [DONE]    Load all students into the DataGridView, ordered by Student_ID
  [DONE]    Click a grid row to load it into the form
  [DONE]    Input validation (required fields, gender, year level, contact number)
  [DONE]    Try/catch error handling with message boxes
  [DONE]    Connection string loaded from appsettings.json
  [TODO]    Live search by Student ID or Name (promised in README)
  [TODO]    Year Level and Program quick filters (promised in README)
  [TODO]    Custom color palette / typography (promised in README)

LICENSE
MIT License, copyright Klink Klank Klan.
</rich_text>
    </node>
