    <node unique_id="27" master_id="0" name="Feature - Select Row to Edit" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
      <rich_text>Handler: dvgStudents_CellContentClick (note the dvg spelling in the method name)

When a row is clicked, the form fields are filled from that row's cells: Student_ID, Full_Name, Gender (matched in cboGender), Year_Level, Program, and Contact_Number if the column exists.

KNOWN ISSUE
CellContentClick only fires when you click the actual cell content (the text). Clicking empty space in the cell does nothing. Using CellClick would make the whole row clickable.
</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="28" master_id="0" name="Feature - Input Validation" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792737899">
      <rich_text>Method: Form1.BuildStudentFromForm()
Shows a "Validation Error" warning MessageBox and stops on the first failure.

Field                 Rule
----------------     -----------------------------------------------------------
Student ID          Required, at least 3 characters
Full name           Required
Gender              Must be Male, Female or Other (case-insensitive check)
Year level           Integer from 1 to 8   (database only accepts 1 to 4)
Program             Required
Contact number   Required, digits only, exactly 11 characters

All text is trimmed before use.
The contact number check only runs if the table has a Contact_Number column (HasColumn).
</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="41" master_id="0" name="Feature - Live Search" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792739098" ts_lastsave="1792739123">
      <rich_text weight="heavy">Live Search</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
The search field filters the data view as you type. There is no search button to click: every keystroke updates the results immediately.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">What it searches</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
• ID
• Name

Only these two fields are scanned. Text that appears in any other field (such as address, notes, or dates) will not produce a match.

</rich_text>
      <rich_text weight="heavy">How it behaves</rich_text>
      <rich_text>
- Typing a character narrows the list to entries whose ID or Name contains that text.
- Deleting a character widens the list again to show more matches.
- Clearing the search field restores the full list.
- If nothing matches, the data view appears empty.</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="29" master_id="0" name="Feature - Error Handling" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792739211">
      <rich_text>Every database action is wrapped in try/catch.

  catch (MySqlException)  -&gt; "Database error while &lt;adding|updating|deleting&gt; the student."
  catch (Exception)          -&gt; "Unable to &lt;add|update|delete&gt; student."
  Form load                    -&gt; "Unable to connect to the database."
  Grid load                     -&gt; "Unable to load student records."

All messages show the exception message below the title line, so the app does not crash on a dropped connection or constraint failure.
</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="30" master_id="0" name="Feature - SQL Safety" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
      <rich_text>All values are passed as MySqlCommand parameters (@Student_ID, @Full_Name, @Gender, @Year_Level, @Program, @Contact_Number) using AddWithValue, which prevents SQL injection through the form fields.

Table and column names are wrapped in backticks and come from internal constants, not user input.

Credentials are kept in appsettings.json, which is gitignored.
</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="31" master_id="0" name="Data Layer - StudentRepository API" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792738655">
      <rich_text>static class StudentRepository  (namespace Interface)

  GetConnectionString()         Finds appsettings.json by walking up from AppContext.BaseDirectory and returns ConnectionStrings:StudentDb.
  IsAllowedGender(string)      True for Male / Female / Other (case-insensitive).
  GetStudentTableName()      Checks information_schema for the first existing candidate table name.
  HasColumn(string)              Checks information_schema for a column in the student table.
  EnsureSchema()                Calls GetStudentTableName() to confirm the table exists.
  LoadStudents()                  Returns a DataTable with all students ordered by Student_ID.
  AddStudent(Student)          INSERT.
  UpdateStudent(Student)      UPDATE by Student_ID; throws if no row matched.
  DeleteStudent(string)         DELETE by Student_ID; throws if no row matched.

Model: Student (StudentId, FullName, Gender, YearLevel, Program, ContactNumber).
</rich_text>
    </node>
  </node>
  <node unique_id="39" master_id="0" name="5. Source Code" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="1" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
    <rich_text>Full source of every file on the main branch (Interface project).</rich_text>
    <node unique_id="33" master_id="0" name="Student.cs" prog_lang="c-sharp" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
      <rich_text>namespace Interface;

public class Student
{
    public string StudentId { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string FullName { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Gender { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public int YearLevel { get; set; }
    public string Program { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string ContactNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}
</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="34" master_id="0" name="StudentRepository.cs" prog_lang="c-sharp" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
      <rich_text>using System.Data;
using Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration;
using MySql.Data.MySqlClient;

namespace Interface;

public static class StudentRepository
{
    private const string DefaultConnectionName = "StudentDb";
    private static readonly string[] AllowedGenders = ["Male", "Female", "Other"];
    private static readonly string[] CandidateTableNames = ["Student", "students", "student", "student_information", "student_information_system"];

    public static string GetConnectionString()
    {
        var directory = new DirectoryInfo(AppContext.BaseDirectory);

        while (directory != null)
        {
            var appSettingsPath = Path.Combine(directory.FullName, "appsettings.json");
            if (File.Exists(appSettingsPath))
            {
                var configuration = new ConfigurationBuilder()
                    .SetBasePath(directory.FullName)
                    .AddJsonFile("appsettings.json", optional: false, reloadOnChange: false)
                    .Build();

                var connectionString = configuration.GetConnectionString(DefaultConnectionName);
                if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(connectionString))
                {
                    return connectionString;
                }

                throw new InvalidOperationException($"Connection string '{DefaultConnectionName}' was not found in appsettings.json.");
            }

            directory = directory.Parent;
        }

        throw new FileNotFoundException("appsettings.json was not found. Place the file in the project root or output folder.");
    }

    public static bool IsAllowedGender(string gender)
    {
        return AllowedGenders.Contains(gender, StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
    }

    public static string GetStudentTableName()
    {
        using var connection = new MySqlConnection(GetConnectionString());
        connection.Open();

        foreach (var tableName in CandidateTableNames)
        {
            using var checkCommand = new MySqlCommand(
                "SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = @tableName LIMIT 1",
                connection);
            checkCommand.Parameters.AddWithValue("@tableName", tableName);

            var exists = checkCommand.ExecuteScalar();
            if (exists != null)
            {
                return tableName;
            }
        }

        throw new InvalidOperationException("No student table was found in the configured database. Verify the table name matches Student_ID, Full_Name, Gender, Year_Level, and Program.");
    }

    public static bool HasColumn(string columnName)
    {
        using var connection = new MySqlConnection(GetConnectionString());
        connection.Open();

        using var command = new MySqlCommand(
            "SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = @tableName AND column_name = @columnName LIMIT 1",
            connection);

        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@tableName", GetStudentTableName());
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@columnName", columnName);

        var exists = command.ExecuteScalar();
        return exists != null;
    }

    public static void EnsureSchema()
    {
        GetStudentTableName();
    }

    public static DataTable LoadStudents()
    {
        var tableName = GetStudentTableName();
        var hasContactColumn = HasColumn("Contact_Number");

        var table = new DataTable();
        table.Columns.Add("Student_ID");
        table.Columns.Add("Full_Name");
        table.Columns.Add("Gender");
        table.Columns.Add("Year_Level", typeof(int));
        table.Columns.Add("Program");

        if (hasContactColumn)
        {
            table.Columns.Add("Contact_Number");
        }

        using var connection = new MySqlConnection(GetConnectionString());
        connection.Open();

        var columns = new[] { "Student_ID", "Full_Name", "Gender", "Year_Level", "Program" };
        if (hasContactColumn)
        {
            columns = columns.Concat(new[] { "Contact_Number" }).ToArray();
        }

        var selectQuery = $"SELECT {string.Join(", ", columns.Select(c =&gt; $"`{c}`"))} FROM `{tableName}` ORDER BY Student_ID";

        using var command = new MySqlCommand(selectQuery, connection);
        using var reader = command.ExecuteReader();
        while (reader.Read())
        {
            var row = table.NewRow();
            row["Student_ID"] = reader["Student_ID"]?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
            row["Full_Name"] = reader["Full_Name"]?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
            row["Gender"] = reader["Gender"]?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
            row["Year_Level"] = reader.GetInt32("Year_Level");
            row["Program"] = reader["Program"]?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
            if (hasContactColumn)
            {
                row["Contact_Number"] = reader["Contact_Number"]?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
            }

            table.Rows.Add(row);
        }

        return table;
    }

    public static void AddStudent(Student student)
    {
        var tableName = GetStudentTableName();
        var hasContactColumn = HasColumn("Contact_Number");
        var columns = new List&lt;string&gt; { "Student_ID", "Full_Name", "Gender", "Year_Level", "Program" };
        var parameters = new List&lt;string&gt; { "@Student_ID", "@Full_Name", "@Gender", "@Year_Level", "@Program" };

        if (hasContactColumn)
        {
            columns.Add("Contact_Number");
            parameters.Add("@Contact_Number");
        }

        using var connection = new MySqlConnection(GetConnectionString());
        connection.Open();

        using var command = new MySqlCommand($"INSERT INTO `{tableName}` ({string.Join(", ", columns.Select(c =&gt; $"`{c}`"))}) VALUES ({string.Join(", ", parameters)})", connection);

        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Student_ID", student.StudentId.Trim());
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Full_Name", student.FullName.Trim());
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Gender", student.Gender);
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Year_Level", student.YearLevel);
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Program", student.Program.Trim());
        if (hasContactColumn)
        {
            command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Contact_Number", string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(student.ContactNumber) ? DBNull.Value : student.ContactNumber.Trim());
        }

        command.ExecuteNonQuery();
    }

    public static void UpdateStudent(Student student)
    {
        var tableName = GetStudentTableName();
        var hasContactColumn = HasColumn("Contact_Number");

        using var connection = new MySqlConnection(GetConnectionString());
        connection.Open();

        var setClauses = new List&lt;string&gt;
        {
            "`Full_Name` = @Full_Name",
            "`Gender` = @Gender",
            "`Year_Level` = @Year_Level",
            "`Program` = @Program"
        };

        if (hasContactColumn)
        {
            setClauses.Add("`Contact_Number` = @Contact_Number");
        }

        using var command = new MySqlCommand($"UPDATE `{tableName}` SET {string.Join(", ", setClauses)} WHERE `Student_ID` = @Student_ID", connection);

        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Student_ID", student.StudentId.Trim());
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Full_Name", student.FullName.Trim());
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Gender", student.Gender);
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Year_Level", student.YearLevel);
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Program", student.Program.Trim());
        if (hasContactColumn)
        {
            command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Contact_Number", string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(student.ContactNumber) ? DBNull.Value : student.ContactNumber.Trim());
        }

        var rowsAffected = command.ExecuteNonQuery();
        if (rowsAffected == 0)
        {
            throw new InvalidOperationException("Student ID was not found for update.");
        }
    }

    public static void DeleteStudent(string studentId)
    {
        var tableName = GetStudentTableName();
        using var connection = new MySqlConnection(GetConnectionString());
        connection.Open();

        using var command = new MySqlCommand($"DELETE FROM `{tableName}` WHERE `Student_ID` = @Student_ID", connection);
        command.Parameters.AddWithValue("@Student_ID", studentId.Trim());

        var rowsAffected = command.ExecuteNonQuery();
        if (rowsAffected == 0)
        {
            throw new InvalidOperationException("Student ID was not found for deletion.");
        }
    }
}
</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="35" master_id="0" name="Form1.cs" prog_lang="c-sharp" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
      <rich_text>using System.Data;
using MySql.Data.MySqlClient;

namespace Interface;

public partial class Form1 : Form
{
    public Form1()
    {
        InitializeComponent();
        Load += Form1_Load;
        btnClear.Click += btnClear_Click;
        btnUpdate.Click += btnUpdate_Click;
        btnDelete.Click += btnDelete_Click;
    }

    private void Form1_Load(object? sender, EventArgs e)
    {
        try
        {
            StudentRepository.EnsureSchema();
            LoadStudents();
            ClearForm();
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Unable to connect to the database.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Database Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
    }

    private void LoadStudents()
    {
        try
        {
            var table = StudentRepository.LoadStudents();
            dgvStudents.DataSource = table;
            dgvStudents.ClearSelection();
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Unable to load student records.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Load Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
    }

    private void ClearForm()
    {
        txtStudentId.Clear();
        txtFullName.Clear();
        cboGender.SelectedIndex = -1;
        txtYearLevel.Clear();
        txtProgram.Clear();
        txtContactNumber.Clear();
        dgvStudents.ClearSelection();
        txtStudentId.Focus();
    }

    private Student? BuildStudentFromForm(bool validateStudentId = true)
    {
        var studentId = txtStudentId.Text.Trim();
        if (validateStudentId &amp;&amp; string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(studentId))
        {
            ShowValidationError("Student ID is required.");
            return null;
        }

        if (validateStudentId &amp;&amp; studentId.Length &lt; 3)
        {
            ShowValidationError("Student ID must be at least 3 characters long.");
            return null;
        }

        var fullName = txtFullName.Text.Trim();
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(fullName))
        {
            ShowValidationError("Full name is required.");
            return null;
        }

        var selectedGender = cboGender.SelectedItem?.ToString();
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(selectedGender) || !StudentRepository.IsAllowedGender(selectedGender))
        {
            ShowValidationError("Please select a valid gender: Male, Female, or Other.");
            return null;
        }

        if (!int.TryParse(txtYearLevel.Text.Trim(), out var yearLevel) || yearLevel &lt; 1 || yearLevel &gt; 8)
        {
            ShowValidationError("Year level must be a number from 1 to 8.");
            return null;
        }

        var program = txtProgram.Text.Trim();
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(program))
        {
            ShowValidationError("Program is required.");
            return null;
        }

        var contactNumber = txtContactNumber.Text.Trim();
        if (StudentRepository.HasColumn("Contact_Number"))
        {
            if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(contactNumber))
            {
                ShowValidationError("Contact number is required.");
                return null;
            }

            if (!contactNumber.All(char.IsDigit))
            {
                ShowValidationError("Contact number must contain exactly 11 digits only.");
                return null;
            }

            if (contactNumber.Length != 11)
            {
                ShowValidationError("Contact number must contain exactly 11 digits only.");
                return null;
            }
        }

        return new Student
        {
            StudentId = studentId,
            FullName = fullName,
            Gender = selectedGender,
            YearLevel = yearLevel,
            Program = program,
            ContactNumber = contactNumber
        };
    }

    private void ShowValidationError(string message)
    {
        MessageBox.Show(message, "Validation Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Warning);
    }

    private void label2_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void label4_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void label5_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void label1_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void groupBox1_Enter(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void label3_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void label6_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void maskedTextBox1_MaskInputRejected(object sender, MaskInputRejectedEventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void cboGender_SelectedIndexChanged(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void button1_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {
        try
        {
            var student = BuildStudentFromForm();
            if (student is null)
            {
                return;
            }

            StudentRepository.AddStudent(student);
            MessageBox.Show("Student record added successfully.", "Success", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Information);
            LoadStudents();
            ClearForm();
        }
        catch (MySqlException ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Database error while adding the student.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Database Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Unable to add student.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
    }

    private void btnUpdate_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {
        try
        {
            var student = BuildStudentFromForm();
            if (student is null)
            {
                return;
            }

            StudentRepository.UpdateStudent(student);
            MessageBox.Show("Student record updated successfully.", "Success", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Information);
            LoadStudents();
            ClearForm();
        }
        catch (MySqlException ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Database error while updating the student.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Database Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Unable to update student.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
    }

    private void btnDelete_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {
        var studentId = txtStudentId.Text.Trim();
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(studentId))
        {
            ShowValidationError("Select a student or enter a Student ID to delete.");
            return;
        }

        var confirm = MessageBox.Show($"Delete student '{studentId}'?", "Confirm Delete", MessageBoxButtons.YesNo, MessageBoxIcon.Warning);
        if (confirm != DialogResult.Yes)
        {
            return;
        }

        try
        {
            StudentRepository.DeleteStudent(studentId);
            MessageBox.Show("Student record deleted successfully.", "Deleted", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Information);
            LoadStudents();
            ClearForm();
        }
        catch (MySqlException ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Database error while deleting the student.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Database Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            MessageBox.Show($"Unable to delete student.\n\n{ex.Message}", "Error", MessageBoxButtons.OK, MessageBoxIcon.Error);
        }
    }

    private void btnClear_Click(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {
        ClearForm();
    }

    private void textBox1_TextChanged(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void textBox6_TextChanged(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void comboBox1_SelectedIndexChanged(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void textBox3_TextChanged(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void textBox2_TextChanged(object sender, EventArgs e)
    {

    }

    private void dvgStudents_CellContentClick(object sender, DataGridViewCellEventArgs e)
    {
        if (e.RowIndex &lt; 0)
        {
            return;
        }

        var row = dgvStudents.Rows[e.RowIndex];
        txtStudentId.Text = row.Cells["Student_ID"].Value?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
        txtFullName.Text = row.Cells["Full_Name"].Value?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
        var gender = row.Cells["Gender"].Value?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
        cboGender.SelectedIndex = cboGender.Items.IndexOf(gender);
        txtYearLevel.Text = row.Cells["Year_Level"].Value?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
        txtProgram.Text = row.Cells["Program"].Value?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;

        if (dgvStudents.Columns.Contains("Contact_Number"))
        {
            txtContactNumber.Text = row.Cells["Contact_Number"].Value?.ToString() ?? string.Empty;
        }
        else
        {
            txtContactNumber.Clear();
        }
    }
}</rich_text>
    </node>
    <node unique_id="36" master_id="0" name="Form1.Designer.cs" prog_lang="c-sharp" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792703477" ts_lastsave="1792703477">
